183 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 69 0 R
/E (Twin castors offer superior load-bearing performance while maintaining consistent overall height. By distributing the weight across two wheels, they minimize floor wear and enhance stability. Unlike single wide wheels, twin castors reduce scrubbing and rolling resistance during directional changes due to the independent rotation of each wheel. This design ensures smoother mobility, particularly under heavy loads. Optional features such as wheel locks, brakes, and swivel locks further enhance their functionality. In environments where height constraints exist but high load capacity is essential, twin castors present an optimal and efficient solution.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
